          "gu_snack_immortal_gu",
          "fac_lang_ya_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya blessed land’s inventory still includes the wood sprout Immortal Gu that Fang Yuan once borrowed to use light fungus radiance, among other Immortal Gu mostly already given out to hairy man Gu Immortals.",
